    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Elemental Energy:</strong> when your familiar appears (Find Familiar), the module asks for Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning or Thunder and gives the familiar Resistance to it. <strong>Energy Pulse:</strong> Bonus Action (the familiar within 120 ft spends its Reaction) - each creature within 5 ft of the familiar makes a DEX save (your spell save DC) or takes 2d4 damage of that type and, if Medium or smaller, falls Prone. Use the activity; the module targets the creatures around the familiar.</p>",
